  "summary": "Malicious code in cli-anything-ai-market (PyPI)",
  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: amazon-inspector (692bd47881a72006971a37c841c289092e652dbd02d576d190d0db1115176719)\nDuring `pip install`, setup.py collects the installer's operating system, username, and hostname and POSTs them to the hardcoded bare-IP endpoint http://182.92.143.23/collect.php over plain HTTP. The package ships no functional code (packages=[]); the install-time beacon is the sole behavior. This is install-time reconnaissance/exfiltration of installer identity to an attacker-controlled destination.\n",
